    {
      "occurrence": 41,
      "number": 119,
      "number_raw": "119",
      "source_number": "119",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Why, any competent blacksmith can make his own anvil!# 'course, I really just sort of learned the craft by practice,# but I made most of my own tools.",
      "source_text": "Why, any competent blacksmith can make his own anvil!\n# 'course, I really just sort of learned the craft by practice,\n# but I made most of my own tools.",
      "source_line_start": 63,
      "source_line_end": 65,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 42,
      "number": 119,
      "number_raw": "119",
      "source_number": "119",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "你不知道吗？任何一个合格的铁匠都能制造自己的铁砧！当然，实际上我也是通过多次的练习才掌握了这门手艺，但我还是可以自己制造大部分的工具。",
      "source_text": "你不知道吗？任何一个合格的铁匠都能制造自己的铁砧！当然，实际上我也是通过多次的练习才掌握了这门手艺，但我还是可以自己制造大部分的工具。",
      "source_line_start": 66,
      "source_line_end": 66,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 43,
      "number": 120,
      "number_raw": "120",
      "source_number": "120",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Mostly I make and repair tools and implements here.# I also fix things for the Hub merchants. With the help of Miles,# the chemist, I reload bullets from time to time.",
      "source_text": "Mostly I make and repair tools and implements here.\n# I also fix things for the Hub merchants. With the help of Miles,\n# the chemist, I reload bullets from time to time.",
      "source_line_start": 68,
      "source_line_end": 70,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 44,
      "number": 120,
      "number_raw": "120",
      "source_number": "120",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "我主要是制造和修理工具和器具什么的。我也为哈勃商人修理东西。有了化学家麦尔斯的帮助，我还可以为子弹填上火药。",
      "source_text": "我主要是制造和修理工具和器具什么的。我也为哈勃商人修理东西。有了化学家麦尔斯的帮助，我还可以为子弹填上火药。",
      "source_line_start": 71,
      "source_line_end": 71,
